<title>UK: Beta Finance sets $200 million three-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Beta Finance sets $200 million three-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BETA FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    01.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9575  PAY DATE    01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.77     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.AUG.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
